"""Import the exact Cake Phase-A FlashKDA prefill exports.

The four architecture-specific export profiles are deliberately accepted as
separate inputs even though their generated CUDA text is currently identical.
This keeps the SM100 and SM103 provenance fibers independent while checking
that the checked-in frozen sources are reproducible from the sealed exports.
"""

